        "\"-(8-(3+2))\""
      ],
      "expectedOutput": "-3",
      "explanation": "The inner parentheses produce 5, then unary minus negates 8 - 5."
    },
    {
      "inputs": [
        "\"1--2\""
      ],
      "expectedOutput": "3",
      "explanation": "The second minus negates 2 before the first minus subtracts it."
    }
  ],
